    body = [=[
=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to Powhatan to start the quest. (You will have to zone after completing {q:Welcome to Bastok|Welcome to Bastok|Welcome to Bastok}.)
* Equip either a {@i:Maul|17045} {p:Maul} or a {@i:Replica Maul|17426} {p:Replica Maul}. There are several ways to obtain one of these items:
** {p:Maul} -
*** Can be purchased from the {z:Auction House}.
*** Dropped by {m:Garnet Quadavs|Garnet Quadav} in {z:Rolanberry Fields} and {z:Beadeaux}.
*** Can be purchased for 228 {p:Sparks of Eminence} from A.M.A.N. representatives.
*** Can be purchased from NPCs {n:Amulya} and {n:Vicious Eye} in {z:Metalworks} (E-9) for roughly 12,000 to 78,000 gil (depending on availability and demand).
** {p:Replica Maul} -
*** Can be purchased from the {z:Auction House}.
*** Found in a {z:Gusgen Mines} {p:Treasure Chest}.
* Speak to {n:Bartolomeo} in {z:Port Bastok} at (F-7) inside the Air Travel Agency. Nothing will happen.
* Revisit Powhatan and select the second option "Where am I supposed to meet your guest?".
* Speak to {p:Steel Bones} in {z:Port Bastok} at (D-8). After the cutscene concludes, you'll receive a {@k} {k:Letter from Domien}.
* Return to Powhatan to complete the quest.

